#: includes/class-vcarb-exports.php:914
msgid ""
"Carbon emissions are estimated based on completed WooCommerce orders during "
"the selected reporting period. Results are intended for operational "
"sustainability analysis rather than certified carbon accounting."
msgstr ""
"L-emissjonijiet tal-karbonju huma stmati abbażi tal-ordnijiet WooCommerce "
"kompluti matul il-perjodu ta' rapportar magħżul. Ir-riżultati huma maħsuba "
"għall-analiżi operattiva tas-sostenibbiltà aktar milli għall-kontabilità tal-"
"karbonju ċċertifikata."

#: includes/class-vcarb-exports.php:1187
msgid ""
"Carbon emissions are estimated based on eligible WooCommerce orders during "
"the selected reporting period. Store totals are calculated from the selected "
"snapshot anchor, and customer-level rows reflect the values stored for that "
"same reporting window. Results are intended for operational sustainability "
"analysis rather than certified carbon accounting."
msgstr ""
"L-emissjonijiet tal-karbonju jiġu stmati abbażi ta' ordnijiet eliġibbli ta' "
"WooCommerce matul il-perjodu magħżul tar-rapport. It-totali tal-ħażna jiġu "
"kkalkulati mill-ankra ta' snapshot magħżula, u r-ringieli fil-livell tal-"
"klijent jirriflettu l-valuri maħżuna għal dik l-istess finestra ta' "
"rapportar. Ir-riżultati huma maħsuba għall-analiżi operattiva tas-"
"sostenibbiltà aktar milli għall-kontabilità tal-karbonju ċċertifikata."

